!                                                                                                   
! This test calculates the spin-orbit components of the 2P state of Fluorine,                       
! using a COSCI wavefunction.                                                                       
!                                                                                                   
**DIRAC                                                                                             
.TITLE                                                                                              
Fluorine atom.                                                                                      
.WAVE F                                                                                             
**GENERAL                                                                                           
.PRINT                                                                                              
1                                                                                                   
**INTEGRALS                                                                                         
*READIN                                                                                             
.UNCONTRACTED                                                                                       
**HAMILTONIAN                                                                                       
.X2C                                                                                                
.DFT                                                                                                
 BP86                                                                                               
.PRINT                                                                                              
0                                                                                                   
**WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                                    
.SCF                                                                                                
.RESOLVE                                                                                            
*SCF                                                                                                
.CLOSED SHELL                                                                                       
4 0                                                                                                 
.OPEN S                                                                                             
1                                                                                                   
5/0,6                                                                                               
.MAXITR                                                                                             
25                                                                                                  
.PRINT                                                                                              
0                                                                                                   
*RESOLVE                                                                                            
.PRINT                                                                                              
0                                                                                                   
*END OF                                                                                             


